  "steps": [
    "Mix the pork mince with garlic, shallot, fish sauce, soy sauce, sugar, black pepper, and a little salt until evenly combined. Shape into 6 to 8 small patties.",
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a frying pan or grill pan over medium-high heat. Cook the patties for about 3 to 4 minutes per side until well browned and cooked through.",
    "Soak or cook the rice noodles according to the packet instructions, then drain and rinse briefly in cold water.",
    "Toss the lime juice and water together to make a quick dressing. Add the cucumber, carrot, chilli, mint, coriander, and spring onion to the noodles and mix well.",
    "Serve the noodles in bowls topped with the grilled pork patties, spoon over any remaining dressing, and finish with extra herbs if you like."
